      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BABY BILLY (7) goes very well this trip starting 13 times for six wins and four minors. Recorded a 1.75 lengths win (20.00) in a Grade 5 last time at this track. Appeals as a leading chance in this. TEA ROSE (8) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a P5 at Capalaba. Well placed here and can atone this time. ROADS (1) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at Capalaba over 366m behind Cyclone Mick (20.56) in a Restricted WIN. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Great chance to atone. LOG ON (6) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
